From 760eba838381429791203ac13c84f9109590efc7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mabn <github@mabn.pl>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:37:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 70/70] [barreplay] P4 v2: Lua waits only at the functions that
 write sim state or read weapon targets (a draining trampoline), COB's Lua
 calls likewise; a slaved weapon's target copy is queued behind its master's
 search; the waiting main thread runs pending searches; worker count from
 toggle bits 24-25; stats interval from BARREPLAY_P4_STATS

